  "instance_name": "food_culinary_skill_pride",
  "label": "Food and Culinary Skill Pride",
  "description": "The cultural phenomenon of expressing pride in one’s family member’s cooking abilities, often as a form of personal or familial affirmation. This is central to the meme’s message, where the text 'my mom makes the best sandwiches' is used to celebrate a specific culinary skill attributed to the mother, which is a common way to express affection and admiration in family contexts.",
